{
 "brief": "The Presidential Supreme Committee for Church Affairs in Palestine sent identical letters to church leaders and heads worldwide expressing deep concern over escalating violence, forced displacement, and persecution of Palestinians, Shehab Wire reported. The committee addressed its appeal to religious authorities across the globe in response to what it characterized as a continuous escalation in acts of violence and systematic forced removals.\n\nThe letters reflect growing alarm among Palestinian Christian institutions over conditions affecting Palestinian populations. The committee's outreach represents an effort to mobilize international religious leadership on the matter of violence and displacement.",
